OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe prime minister has announced a #65
OL,7,Fmillion funding boost for farmers to
OL,8,Fhelp the industry cope with the
OL,9,Fongoing drought.
OL,11,FThe announcement follows the
OL,12,Fgovernment's emergency response
OL,13,Fcommittee (COBR), which Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fled earlier this week on the national
OL,15,Fresponse to extreme heat, wildfires
OL,16,Fand drought.
OL,18,FFarmers across England will receive
OL,19,Fthis new support to help manage the
OL,20,Fimpact of this period of prolonged dry
OL,21,Fweather.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
