PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786781885
OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe package forms part of the
OL,7,Fgovernment's response to the drought,
OL,8,Fbringing together action on farming,
OL,9,Fwater and vital infrastructure.
OL,11,FThe government said the funding would
OL,12,Fhelp farmers get water to crops, keep
OL,13,Flivestock fed where grass is now
OL,14,Ffailing and continue environmental
OL,15,Fagreements without losing payments.
OL,17,FThey have promised an additional #50
OL,18,Fmillion for the Sustainable Farming
OL,19,FIncentive 2026, meaning the total
OL,20,Fbudget for farm support comes to #290
OL,21,Fmillion.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
