FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786781885
OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FFarmers will also be supported to
OL,7,Fbuild on-farm water storage, helping
OL,8,Ffarms prepare for future dry summers,
OL,9,Fin addition to support from the
OL,10,FEnvironment Agency and easier access
OL,11,Fto water long term.
OL,13,FBurnham is expected to visit a farm on
OL,14,FSaturday to meet with farmers impacted
OL,15,Fby the driest July on record.
OL,17,FThere are also plans to make it easier
OL,18,Fto build reservoirs, with changes to
OL,19,Fthe National Planning Policy
OL,20,FFramework, with the last reservoir
OL,21,Fbuilt in the UK in 1991.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
