OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786781885
OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe government has already announced
OL,7,Fplans to support the development of
OL,8,Fnine new reservoirs, in order to
OL,9,F"strengthen the country's water
OL,10,Finfrastructure and improve resilience
OL,11,Fto future droughts, floods and extreme
OL,12,Fweather".
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
