OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe environment secretary, Angela
OL,7,FEagle, said she is aware of the
OL,8,Fpressures farmers are facing in this
OL,9,Fweather and promised to continue
OL,10,Fworking with the industry to build
OL,11,Fresilience for the future.
OL,13,FShe said: "I am acutely aware of the
OL,14,Fpressures exceptionally dry weather is
OL,15,Fplacing on farm businesses.
OL,26,@uD@KOU
