PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786781885
OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,F"Our farmers are facing some of the
OL,7,Ftoughest conditions in decades, which
OL,8,Fis why we're stepping in with
OL,9,Fpractical support to help them through
OL,10,Fthese challenging conditions and build
OL,11,Fresilience for the future.
OL,13,F"We'll continue working closely with
OL,14,Ffarmers and our partners to respond to
OL,15,Fthe impacts of the drought, while
OL,16,Fbuilding a stronger, more resilient
OL,17,Ffarming sector through our Farming
OL,18,FRoadmap."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@IO]
