OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786781885
OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe government insists that this
OL,7,Fimmediate action will help farmers but
OL,8,Fthat the country must adapt to the
OL,9,Fchanging climate.
OL,11,FOn Friday, during a visit to the West
OL,12,FMidlands, where wildfires have burned
OL,13,Fthrough homes, Burnham announced a ban
OL,14,Fon disposable barbecues to try and
OL,15,Fprotect the country against further
OL,16,Foutbreaks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
