OL,3,CBurnham announces #65m funding boost
OL,4,Cfor drought-hit farmers
OL,6,FThe government has also pledged to
OL,7,Fspend almost #100 million to
OL,8,F"strengthen the country's response to
OL,9,Fwildfires and extreme weather" and
OL,10,Fappointed a fire minister.
OL,12,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,13,Four political experts are across all
OL,14,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,15,Fto the latest episode below...
